{"title": "Boon of the Unstoppable", "pageid": 26477, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Boon_of_the_Unstoppable", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp, /w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Boon of the Unstoppable</b> is a special class action automatically used every turn by the <a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_Bhaal\" title=\"Boon of Bhaal\">Boon of Bhaal</a>. It gives Orin 7 stacks of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstoppable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\">Unstoppable</a>. This is increased to 12 on <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> difficulty and above.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nBhaal suffuses you with terrible power, making you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstoppable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\">Unstoppable</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 50 m (167 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 50 m (167 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_BhaalTemple_OrinBuff</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_BhaalTemple_OrinBuff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_BhaalTemple_OrinBuff\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Normal version that grants 7 stacks</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_BhaalTemple_OrinBuff_Hardcore</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_BhaalTemple_OrinBuff_Hardcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_BhaalTemple_OrinBuff_Hardcore\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Tactician version that grants 12 stacks</div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreBlindness_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreBlindness (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreBlindness</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Unstoppable\"> Condition: Unstoppable </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstoppable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\">Unstoppable</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 7  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Reduce the next damage taken by the entity to 1 and consumes one charge of Unstoppable. Unstoppable creatures cannot be moved by any external forces — mundane or magical.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_Bhaal\" title=\"Boon of Bhaal\">Boon of Bhaal</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When the Bhaal cultists chant their ritual to trigger this action, it applies a bugged status condition that displays as Unstoppable but lacks any actual damage reduction. For this reason, the first damage instance each round is not reduced to 1.</li>\n<li>Subsequent damage instances in the same round are properly reduced to 1 by the correct Unstoppable status condition.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715045248\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2683/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34443/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13123/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1084607/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n112.22%   67.524     33 Template:Trim\n100.00%   60.171      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   60.171      1 -total\n 29.55%   17.782      2 Template:Cond\n 21.02%   12.645      4 Template:Icon_text\n 20.44%   12.300      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 18.94%   11.395      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.15%   10.317      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 12.98%    7.810      4 Template:Ifempty\n 12.80%    7.702      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:26477-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715045248 and revision id 370924. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}